      "number": 3,
      "pali": "Dutiyarūpārāmasutta ",
      "english": "Liking Sights (2nd) "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Rūpārāmā, bhikkhave, devamanussā rūparatā rūpasammuditā. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, gods and humans like sights, they love them and enjoy them. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Rūpavipariṇāmavirāganirodhā dukkhā, bhikkhave, devamanussā viharanti. ",
      "english": "But when sights perish, fade away, and cease, gods and humans live in suffering. … "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Saddārāmā … ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "gandhārāmā … ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "rasārāmā … ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "pali": "phoṭṭhabbārāmā … ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "dhammārāmā, bhikkhave, devamanussā dhammaratā dhammasammuditā. ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "Dhammavipariṇāmavirāganirodhā dukkhā, bhikkhave, devamanussā viharanti. ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "pali": "Tathāgato ca, bhikkhave, arahaṁ sammāsambuddho rūpānaṁ samudayañca atthaṅgamañca assādañca ādīnavañca nissaraṇañca yathābhūtaṁ viditvā na rūpārāmo na rūparato na rūpasammudito. ",
      "english": "The Realized One has truly understood the origin, disappearance, gratification, drawback, and escape of sights, so he doesn’t like, love, or enjoy them. "
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "pali": "Rūpavipariṇāmavirāganirodhā sukho, bhikkhave, tathāgato viharati. ",
      "english": "When sights perish, fade away, and cease, the Realized One lives happily. …” "
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "pali": "Saddānaṁ … ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
